    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/ed393aeaa317dc54a1403789d74453ab.poster.avif?t=1743006931\" width=718 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/ed393aeaa317dc54a1403789d74453ab.webm?t=1743006931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/ed393aeaa317dc54a1403789d74453ab.mp4?t=1743006931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galago is a <strong>2D</strong>\u00a0<strong>exploration-platformer</strong>, blending <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, <strong>survival</strong>, and  <strong>mystery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the 6 <strong>golden fireflies</strong> per level. Some are <strong>hidden</strong>, others are in plain-sight, yet seemingly out of reach...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you explore, your endeavour will be hindered by\u00a0<strong>hunger</strong>, <strong>hazards\u00a0</strong>and <strong>predators</strong>. To survive, you must <strong>forage</strong> for tree sap and insects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not the galago's natural habitat \u2014 you are  in the city's <strong>wealthiest</strong> <strong>suburb</strong>. As you skitter along walls, peering through warmly lit windows, what <strong>stories</strong> might you witness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/742aace5b29728d3816aed1d9c5547ec.poster.avif?t=1743006931\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/742aace5b29728d3816aed1d9c5547ec.webm?t=1743006931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/742aace5b29728d3816aed1d9c5547ec.mp4?t=1743006931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/ed393aeaa317dc54a1403789d74453ab.poster.avif?t=1743006931\" width=718 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/ed393aeaa317dc54a1403789d74453ab.webm?t=1743006931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/ed393aeaa317dc54a1403789d74453ab.mp4?t=1743006931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galago is a <strong>2D</strong>\u00a0<strong>exploration-platformer</strong>, blending <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, <strong>survival</strong>, and  <strong>mystery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the 6 <strong>golden fireflies</strong> per level. Some are <strong>hidden</strong>, others are in plain-sight, yet seemingly out of reach...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you explore, your endeavour will be hindered by\u00a0<strong>hunger</strong>, <strong>hazards\u00a0</strong>and <strong>predators</strong>. To survive, you must <strong>forage</strong> for tree sap and insects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not the galago's natural habitat \u2014 you are  in the city's <strong>wealthiest</strong> <strong>suburb</strong>. As you skitter along walls, peering through warmly lit windows, what <strong>stories</strong> might you witness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/742aace5b29728d3816aed1d9c5547ec.poster.avif?t=1743006931\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/742aace5b29728d3816aed1d9c5547ec.webm?t=1743006931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/742aace5b29728d3816aed1d9c5547ec.mp4?t=1743006931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "As night falls, a galago \u2014 also known as a bush baby \u2014 ventures into suburbia, searching for elusive golden fireflies. But the world is perilous for one so small\u2026 Galago is an exploration-platformer, blending puzzle-solving, survival, and mystery.\u00a0",
